uilding a life means earning your next wage packet, paying the rent and finding the armchair that makes the flat feel like yours.\n\nThe work is hands-on: drive the parcel van to the right doors, take the number 12 round its bus stops, make butties at Caf\u00e9 Rosa, pull pints at the Red Lion or wait tables at the Kettleby Tandoori. Between shifts, decorate your home, keep a pet, help the neighbours or head home to the family for Sunday dinner.\n\nKettleby follows the real calendar, with spring blossom, autumn leaves, Bonfire Night fireworks and Christmas lights. It is a small British town built from familiar details: the street group chat, the electricity top-up, a parcel left with a neighbour, and ducks that would prefer peas to bread.", "themes": [{"id": 28, "name": "Business"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/kettle-street", "videos": [{"id": 203519, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Iv1JKyL-U6g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iv1JKyL-U6g", "title": "Kettle Street Game Trailer October", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Iv1JKyL-U6g/sddefault.jpg"}]}